SUMMARY:Davis Art Studio Tour
DESCRIPTION:Forty-eight artists from across the region will open their Davis studios for the free self-guided Davis Art Studio Tour where hundreds of guests can immerse themselves in the creative spaces where local artwork is being crafted. The two-day public event will take place May 16-17 from 10 a.m. to 5 p.m. and will include opportunities to view and purchase a wide range of artwork\, from sculpture and painting to print making and photography. For information about participating artists and studio locations\, visit www.davisopenstudios.com. \nThe Davis Art Studio Tour began more than two decades ago and became a casualty of the pandemic until 2023 when a small group of local artists formed a grassroots effort to bring the tour back to life with 21 artists showing their work. In 2024 and 2025\, they doubled the number of artists featured\, and this year will showcase 48 artists to hundreds of guests on the tour. For more information\, visit www.davisopenstudios.com.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/davis-art-studio-tour-2/
CATEGORIES:Art,Bring the Kids,Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/DAST-Team-2026-Horizontal-Low-Res.jpg
END:VEVENT
