SUMMARY:Cool Davis: Home Energy Score Workshop & Home Tours
DESCRIPTION:Cool Davis will host a free Make a Plan / Home Energy Score Workshop at Davis Senior Center; Sunday\, May 17th 12PM – 2:30PM. Electric Home Tours will follow at sites around Davis from 1PM – 4PM; offering attendees a practical\, hands-on opportunity to improve home efficiency\, lower energy costs\, and plan for electrification. \nResidents can register in advance to attend both the workshop and the home tours. Registration and\ninformation can be found under the “NEWS” section at cooldavis.org. \nWith a statewide Home Energy Score program launching 2026\, the event also\nprovides an opportunity for homeowners to understand how scoring works and how to\nprepare for upcoming requirements and opportunities. \n 
