SUMMARY:The Rotary Club of Davis Annual BBQ 2026
DESCRIPTION:The Rotary Club of Davis Annual BBQ is scheduled for Sunday\, May 17\, 2026\, from 4 pm to 7 pm at Davis Central Park. It promises an unforgettable afternoon of sizzling barbecue\, live entertainment\, and the opportunity to connect with fellow community members. \nAt this event\, attendees can enjoy dinner prepared by The Davis Firefighters Local 3494. They will serve Tri-tip\, beans\, salad\, and ice cream. Vegetarian lasagna is available upon request for those with dietary restrictions. \nAdding to the festive ambiance\, live music from Cold Shot will set the mood\, creating an atmosphere of celebration and enjoyment. To complement the savory fare\, cold beer and wine will be available for purchase\, providing the perfect accompaniment to the culinary delights. \nIn essence\, the Rotary Club of Davis Annual BBQ 2026 is not just a culinary event but a celebration of community spirit and philanthropy. Attendees can come together to enjoy delicious food and vibrant music and positively impact the world around them. \nAll proceeds support local Davis charities and Rotary International projects\, making a positive impact right in our backyard and around the globe. \nTickets are $45 per person. You can click the link below to purchase a ticket online or contact your local Rotarian. (https://qrco.de/bfibdB) \nWe extend our heartfelt gratitude to our major sponsors—Tandem\, Revology\, and Paul Lacoste\, CFP® of Charles Schwab—for their generous support and commitment to our community. \nAdditionally\, we would like to recognize our valued sponsors: Ted & Kathy Puntillo\, Revaire Creative\, Balance Point Pilates Studio\, Armadillo Music\, Strelitzia Flower Company\, Deraaugh Mansion Dawson\, and Tim Ainsworth. We also thank the Davis Fire Department Local 3494 for their continued partnership.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/the-rotary-club-of-davis-annual-bbq-2026/
LOCATION:Central Park – Davis\, 5th St & B St\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community,Food & Drink,Music,Outside,Stage & Dance
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Rotary-Club-of-Davis-Annual-BBQ-2026-Flyer_v1-copy-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Rotary Club of Davis":MAILTO:info@rotaryclubofdavis.com
GEO:38.5466823;-121.7454954
